              "action": "spotlight",
              "target": "memory"
            },
            {
              "action": "seek",
              "observe": "stale-rejected"
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "observe": "stale-rejected"
            },
            {
              "action": "narrate",
              "text": "如果你运行的是冲突组：过时版本的写入被拒绝，现值没有被覆盖；随后用当前版本更新，版本加一。"
            },
            {
              "action": "seek",
              "observe": "expired-hidden"
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "observe": "expired-hidden"
            },
            {
              "action": "narrate",
              "text": "如果你运行的是过期删除组：过期只影响读取，记录这时仍在数据库里。"
            },
            {
              "action": "seek",
              "observe": "deleted-absent"
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "observe": "deleted-absent"
            },
            {
              "action": "narrate",
              "text": "显式删除后再读取为空。过期是读取策略，删除是存储操作，证据要分开看。"
            },
            {
              "action": "spotlight",
              "target": "runtime"
            },
            {
              "action": "seek",
              "observe": "lifecycle-check"
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "observe": "lifecycle-check"
            },
            {
              "action": "narrate",
              "text": "报告把每一步的检查结果列出来，每项都来自真实的数据库操作。"
            },
            {
              "action": "seek",
              "observe": "final-retrievable"
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "observe": "final-retrievable"
            },
            {
              "action": "narrate",
              "text": "最后再打开一次连接核对：冲突组能读回更新后的值，过期删除组什么也读不到。"
            }
          ],
          "conclusion": {
            "proves": [
